  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Romero House Skill-Exchange Syria Programme Partners</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The present fund will support Basmeh and Zeitooneh, Caritas Lebanon and Women Now for Development to attend a skill-exchange and learning workshop on fundraising at Romero House from the 16th to the 20th June 2025. 
CAFOD&apos;s Ukraine and Syria Programme have worked together to invited Fundraising staff from 5 of CAFOD&#x2019;s partner organisations located in Syria, Lebanon, Romania and Ukraine. The week will be organised around different forms of fundraising, with sessions delivered by CAFOD teams, and opportunities for peer learning across the participating organisations. We intend the sessions to be theoretical, but also practical, with the opportunity to participate in real-life fundraising events alongside CAFOD staff.</narrative>
  </description>
